  "text": {
    "la-Vulgata": "Dixit ergo eis Iesus: Amen amen dico vobis: nisi manducaveritis carnem Filii hominis, et biberitis eius sanguinem, non habebitis vitam in vobis.",
    "en-DRC": "Then Jesus said to them: Amen, amen I say unto you: Except you eat the flesh of the Son of man, and drink his blood, you shall not have life in you."
  },
